    "description": {
      "value": "This elegant copper ring has miniature images of songbirds engraved around its circumference. You gain a +1 item bonus to Deception checks.\n\nActivate (2 Actions)\nFrequency: once per day\nTwisting the ring around your finger allows you to magically throw your voice, with the effects of a ventriloquism spell (DC 19).\n\nThe ring grants a +2 bonus. When you activate the ring, you gain the effects of 2nd-level ventriloquism (DC 27). You can activate the ring any number of times per day."
